The '''GR-series''' was a line of [[freighter]]s and [[transport]]s from [[Gallofree Yards, Inc.]] that included the [[GR-45 medium transport]] and the larger [[GR-75 medium transport]]. The GR-series was characterized by its open clamshell design.<ref name="BMF 20" />

